that I had no real passion.

00:04:46.234 --> 00:04:47.134
It was psychology.

00:04:47.134 --> 00:04:48.033
I have a psych degree.

00:04:48.033 --> 00:04:49.844
Mostly because that's what my sister did.

00:04:49.844 --> 00:04:51.257
