00:55:26.270 --> 00:55:27.310
- [Lilly] You still up for this Gary?

00:55:27.310 --> 00:55:28.188
- Of course I'm up for this.

00:55:28.188 --> 00:55:29.021
(Lilly laughing)

00:55:29.021 --> 00:55:29.854
You're gonna fly to LA,

00:55:29.854 --> 00:55:31.105
this is what's fun about being global.

00:55:31.105 --> 00:55:31.938
You're gonna fly to LA,

00:55:31.938 --> 00:55:34.621
