the LA office of Vayner,

00:55:34.621 --> 00:55:35.756
we're gonna hang out,

00:55:35.756 --> 00:55:36.963
then we're gonna go do the show.

00:55:36.963 --> 00:55:39.023
You're gonna hang out in
your bigger green room.

00:55:39.023 --> 00:55:40.186
I'll come and visit.

00:55:40.186 --> 00:55:42.491
