00:55:54.413 --> 00:55:57.807
(all laughing)

00:55:57.807 --> 00:55:59.141
Jamie we'll see you soon.

00:55:59.141 --> 00:56:00.089
- [Lilly] Thanks Jamie.

00:56:00.089 --> 00:56:01.252
- You better start crying,
you're coming to LA.

00:56:01.252 --> 00:56:02.085
We'll see you soon.

00:56:02.085 --> 00:56:03.264
- I'll be seeing you Jamie, bye.

00:56:03.264 --> 00:56:06.045
- [Jamie] You got it, thank you.

00:56:06.045 --> 00:56:06.949
- [Lilly] Look at us.
- We're fun.

00:56:06.949 --> 00:56:07.890
- Look at you making dreams come.

00:56:07.890 --> 00:56:08.754
- [Gary] Look at us.

00:56:08.754 --> 00:56:09.587
- Look at us.

00:56:09.587 --> 00:56:10.420
- You.

00:56:10.420 --> 00:56:11.253
- [Lilly] You.

00:56:11.253 --> 00:56:12.086
- You.

00:56:12.086 --> 00:56:13.301
- [Lilly] I'm just texting
my booker right now,

00:56:13.301 --> 00:56:15.037
saying "We need to get Gary on the show."

00:56:15.037 --> 00:56:16.438
I'm kidding, we're already working on it.

00:56:16.438 --> 00:56:17.349
- (Gary sighing) Thank you.

00:56:17.349 --> 00:56:18.272
- [Lilly] Thank you.

00:56:18.272 --> 00:56:19.105
This was a great conversation.
- This was a lot of fun.

00:56:19.105 --> 00:56:19.938
- [Lilly] Thank you, more to come.

00:56:19.938 --> 00:56:20.771
