00:56:20.771 --> 00:56:21.604
I really wish you nothing but success.

00:56:21.604 --> 00:56:22.437
- [Lilly] Thank you so much.

00:56:22.437 --> 00:56:24.022
Please Vayner nation support this show.

00:56:24.022 --> 00:56:25.142
Getting off to a big start

00:56:25.142 --> 00:56:27.290
